  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">JUST REACT 2.0 - Strengthened Civil Society Role in Fighting Social Inequality and Gender-Based Violence in Kosovo</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;The Overall Objective of this project is to further strengthen the role and capacities of GLPS &#xbf; and civil society in general - in fighting social inequalities, advancing participatory democracy, and ensuring proper access to justice for all via informed citizenry and increased institutional performance.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;The Specific Objectives (SOs) of this action are:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;SO.1: Increased role and relevance of the organization in monitoring and overseeing the rule of law sector performance in handling gender-based and discrimination cases;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;SO.2: Improved access to justice and social protection for women, youth and marginalized groups;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;SO.3: Increased institutional performance and efficiency in handling gender-based violence, discrimination and social inequalities via sophisticated gender-responsive monitoring, trend analysis and policy research;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;SO.4: Increasing young men and women skills and employability via innovative capacity building activities;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;SO.5: Strengthened role of civil society in engaging with policy shaping and implementation;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;SO.6: Increased capacities of local organizations/grassroots in engaging with the policy and decision-making at local level on specific human rights issues via grant schemes and awareness raising.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
